        {
          "resource_id": "monster_action",
          "stats": {
            "action_name": {
              "value": "Spore Cloud"
            },
            "action_description": {
              "value": "(inhaled, poison)\n\nRequirements: The Melfesh Monster has created a spore cloud, and the cloud is within range of one of the Melfesh Monster's fire abilities;\n\nFrequency: 1/minute\n\nThe Melfesh Monster conjures a cloud of spores within 60 feet in a 20-foot burst. The cloud lasts 1 minute. Creatures that enter or begin their turn within the cloud must succeed at a 21 Fortitude save or take 3d8 poison damage, be sickened 2, and inhale spores that remain in their bodies for 1 minute (on a critical failure, sickened 3 and an additional 4 persistent poison damage)."
            },
